  "content": "Side-by-Side Pricing Plans: Simple Style Guide for Elements Link: https://support.brilliantdirectories.com/support/solutions/articles/12000034719 In this article, the styling Classes of the Pricing Page menu will be outlined: The Pricing Page modules consists of: 1. Title 2. Price 3. Sub-Price 4. Features 5. Checkout Button How Are These Applied in the Admin Dashboard? Title For Title use the class \" title \": Price For the Price use the class \" price \": Sub Price For the Sub Pricing use the class \" sub- price \": Button To create a button, we recommend using the class \" btn btn-success btn-lg vmargin bold \". For additional assistance: Email support@brilliantdirectories.com or create a ticket Inside Your Account Dashboard . Was this article helpful and accurate? Yes No Send feedback Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
